Error [jet.InvalidEmbedPath]: `find` glob `inputs/../*.jet` can't use `..`
  --> tests/ui/comptime_find_computed_dotdot.jet:2:13
    |
  2 | PATHS: #run find("inputs/{UP}/*.jet")
    |             ^^^^
 Why: Comptime inputs are named from this file's own directory down, so a build can audit them; `..` is refused in a computed glob too
 Fix: Compute a glob under this file's directory, without `..`
